73b04d637634 -> 6169e8e96164, tree 697a080f3e86d368c31b82daf9088ee834537db6f3f49888dfcc7aa9c9ecfb4f.

No workflow reference names this leg, so the gitlink and the pin file are the whole of it.

The gitlink at code, `commit:` and `digests.tree_sha256` in contracts/code-pin.yaml, and every workflow reference to opensoft/openRepoTools-code move in ONE commit because `scripts/validate-pins.py` refuses when they disagree — a gitlink advanced alone is red on the next pull request, and on somebody else's change.

Written by openRepoShape's `scripts/bump-leg.py`; the digest is recomputed from the leg's own objects, not adjusted.

